{%- comment -%}
  theinmag-videos-data  (built 2026-10-20 for the YouTube launch, Webster)

  THE ONE PLACE a video is added to the site. Every video surface reads
  this list: the /pages/videos hub (theinmag-video-hub + theinmag-video-row),
  each watch page (theinmag-video-watch), and any "latest videos" row
  dropped onto the homepage, the "for" pages or a post later.

  How to add a video (about two minutes, do it the day the video is
  SCHEDULED, not the day it goes live):
    1. Add one record below, newest at the TOP. The live_from time gates
       it: before that moment every surface shows it as "out <day>", after
       it the embed and the VideoObject schema switch on by themselves.
    2. Put a 1280x720 thumbnail in assets as <thumb>.jpg plus a 640 wide
       <thumb>-640.jpg (the real YouTube thumbnail, never a stand-in).
    3. In admin, create a page whose handle = the record's handle,
       template "video" (Theme template: page.video), SEO title + meta
       description filled, transcript pasted as the page content.
  Nothing else changes: no template edits, no hub edits.

  Record format: one line per video, fields joined by ^^ , records
  separated by @@ . Field order (keep it, consumers read by index):
    0 handle        page handle of the watch page (/pages/<handle>)
    1 youtube_id
    2 show          picnic | fieldnotes | start  ("start" = the one "Start here"
                    video above the hub search; never listed in rows, search or
                    schema lists; hidden while youtube_id is blank)
    3 title         sentence case, site version of the YouTube title
    4 live_from     ISO 8601 with offset (Brisbane is +10:00, no DST)
    5 live_label    human "out" label, e.g. Thu 29 Oct, 9am (Brisbane)
    6 duration_iso  e.g. PT13M0S (for VideoObject)
    7 minutes       card label, e.g. 13 min
    8 thumb         asset base name, no extension
    9 card_line     one line for cards (under 20 words)
   10 summary       two or three sentences for the watch page + schema
   11 points        "In this video" bullets joined by ;;
   12 kid_credit    real attribution only, from the video itself: FIRST NAME ONLY,
                    never an age or surname (watch page only, never on cards); blank if none
   13 post_handle   paired field notes post handle (the post shows this video
                    automatically, no metafield needed); blank if none
   14 area          learning area tag on cards, Australian Curriculum naming where
                    it is a lesson (Mathematics, English, Science, Wellbeing...),
                    a plain topic for Field Notes (Mindset, Homeschooling)
   15 keywords      40+ comma-separated search terms (guide: KNOWLEDGE.md, "Video
                    keywords"). AU + US + UK spellings, parent phrasing, teacher jargon.
   16 preview_url   silent hover clip on Shopify Files (cdn.shopify.com URL); blank = no hover
   17 end           literal "end" (stops Liquid's split dropping blank tail fields)

  Never use ^^ , @@ , ;; or a long dash inside a field.
{%- endcomment -%}
